0,Koma language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Koma_language,"Niger–Congo?There are about 3,000 Gimnime speakers in the Northern Region, in Faro department (in Béka commune, around Wangay). Their language is closer to Kompana than to Koma (Koma Ndera). It is also found in Nigeria.",Gimnime,Niger-Congo
